    "text": "How may optical isomers are possible for<br />\r<br />\r<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><munder><mrow><mover><mrow><mover><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mover></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mover><mo>—</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></munder><munder><mrow><mover><mrow><mover><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mover></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mover><mo>—</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math>"
